      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You need approximately 60 g of dk-weight yarn in three shades: main tabby (orange or grey), white for the muzzle and belly, and dark for stripe details. Use a 3.5 mm hook throughout. Four 12 mm "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "safety-eyes"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "safety eyes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (two green for the cat, two small black for the nose triangle), polyester stuffing, and one tapestry needle complete the kit."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
