          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to attach the head to the top of the body. Pin the front legs to the lower body sides and the back legs to the base. Sew the ears to the top of the head with 3 stitches apart. Tuck the tail base under the back of the body and secure firmly. Use the yarn tail to embroider three whisker lines on each cheek using straight stitch."
          }
